2694_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pzkVgbrD4J8Q7kNvwHTj4RX&_nc_oc=Adn_Wco3Q2hW7JVEmPRkwkpVs_mSUrOxAiRGgC2lUXTS5ZPl94lRib6aXQ9lBF_1cuQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvuyoopx5sUQi1vySrHF7WoZhqRoPXAsnnufBNwTJp4-Q&oe=69A2DD9C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "f763aa0857754878a1aa0baa4c822193.png", "id": "1887493012186786", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304764_1887493015520119_8852669086761048292_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8VZ-spj6XPoQ7kNvwEijinR&_nc_oc=AdlBROgrpYXP5mPSboVBeHl8ko4QoFCSzcyQEWc0IX4pjdlCFIqZfKTo5DjyM-zaZ6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs3oe9bLSoj0iYTgK4fdzlZDQau7_MWRUjbUNCJ3LJVvA&oe=69A2FCF1"}, "display_name": "Astro Penguin", "keywords": ["platformer", "adventure", "penguin", "astro"], "long_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is an experimental, single-player VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings.", "short_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is a VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://w